WEBVTT

00:13:58.454 --> 00:14:03.496
And so I used to encourage
my students to give up.

00:14:04.579 --> 00:14:09.287
At a certain point, I suddenly never
wanted to read a dissertation by

00:14:09.287 --> 00:14:13.412
a student with a chapter that would
explain why the experiment failed.

00:14:14.162 --> 00:14:19.871
So that was the kind of advice that I
would give them. Think of another idea.

00:14:21.162 --> 00:14:24.204
Do you ever worry about
getting too detached?

00:14:24.287 --> 00:14:30.162
I think, for example, about messenger
RNA technology, which was seen as,